---
import data from '../../data/site.json';
---
<section id="contact" class="section tint" aria-labelledby="contact-title" tabindex="-1"><div class="container contact-grid reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow">05 / CONTACT</p><h2 id="contact-title">Let’s connect.</h2><p>Joining, volunteering, mentoring, or working together.<br/>We’d love to hear what you have in mind.</p></div><div class="contact-details"><div><h3>Club email</h3>{data.email?<a class="text-link" href={`mailto:${data.email}`}>{data.email}</a>:<p class="todo">[TODO: public club email]</p>}</div><div><h3>Follow along</h3>{data.socials.length?data.socials.map(s=><a class="social-link" href={s.url}>{s.label} ↗</a>):<p class="todo">[TODO: verified social profile links]</p>}</div><p class="small">This static website does not collect contact submissions. An external sign-up form will be linked once approved.</p></div></div></section>
